    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0459979_sol.JPG\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 170px;\" /></p><p>At surface (1)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>…</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />At surface (2)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>cos</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />From equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">⁡</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt></mfenced><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi></math>&nbsp;must satisfy,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&lt;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><mfrac><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfenced></math></p>",
